abstract: >-
  Code, configuration, provenance records and small source-data tables for an
  exploratory cross-dataset evaluation of a locked FAP/adenoma-associated
  epithelial stem/progenitor transcriptional module. The package preserves the
  negative prespecified analysis and explicit negative, skipped and
  not-estimable outcomes.
